(7521111, 1201549, 136989, '<td valign="top">Add a rainbow to this and I''d know for sure I was dreaming.  This is gorgeous!!  So many wonderful shades of green and things to explore all across the composition. I love how you timed it for the light to really make the grass glow.</td>', 'Add a rainbow to this and I''d know for sure I was dreaming.  This is gorgeous!!  So many wonderful shades of green and things to explore all across the composition. I love how you timed it for the light to really make the grass glow.', '2017-07-01 17:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521136, 1201785, 150202, '<td valign="top">Pretty colors with the purples and yellow, but I''m personally not a fan of the harshness of the light.  Definitely kept the light as the main feature though!</td>', 'Pretty colors with the purples and yellow, but I''m personally not a fan of the harshness of the light.  Definitely kept the light as the main feature though!', '2017-07-02 06:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521137, 1201714, 150202, '<td valign="top">I like how the narrowing of the pier in the distance draws your eye towards the beautiful clouds.  The tones are just right to give a soft, old time impression.  Only thing I''m not keen on is a little too "busy" on the pier.  Great photo!</td>', 'I like how the narrowing of the pier in the distance draws your eye towards the beautiful clouds.  The tones are just right to give a soft, old time impression.  Only thing I''m not keen on is a little too "busy" on the pier.  Great photo!', '2017-07-02 06:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521138, 1201721, 150202, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I love the perspective and light!  I do wish the bottom was a bit darker or cropped as I find it a tad distracting personally.  Really impressive shot overall!</td>', 'Interesting shot, I love the perspective and light!  I do wish the bottom was a bit darker or cropped as I find it a tad distracting personally.  Really impressive shot overall!', '2017-07-02 06:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521139, 1201782, 150202, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice.  The compositing is slightly off level and my eye isn''t sure what the subject is.  The way the light reflects of the Marriott is really neat though, woul dhave like to see that closer.</td>', 'The lighting is nice.  The compositing is slightly off level and my eye isn''t sure what the subject is.  The way the light reflects of the Marriott is really neat though, woul dhave like to see that closer.', '2017-07-02 06:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521140, 1201757, 150202, '<td valign="top">Just fantastic!  Beautiful colors and enough brightness of the buildings to bring them out, while still keeping the colors from the sun.  I might reduce the sharpness or contrast or something on the foreground just a tad as it does make it look a bit too separate from the background, but that''s pretty minor.  Well done!</td>', 'Just fantastic!  Beautiful colors and enough brightness of the buildings to bring them out, while still keeping the colors from the sun.  I might reduce the sharpness or contrast or something on the foreground just a tad as it does make it look a bit too separate from the background, but that''s pretty minor.  Well done!', '2017-07-02 06:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521141, 1201549, 150202, '<td valign="top">The light and clouds are great and the tone of the foreground combines to make a terrific shot.</td>', 'The light and clouds are great and the tone of the foreground combines to make a terrific shot.', '2017-07-02 06:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521142, 1201393, 150202, '<td valign="top">Neat scene.  For me the white of the clouds and on the sand is too bright and makes it hard to see the landscape.  I like the composition with the one person walking on the beach.</td>', 'Neat scene.  For me the white of the clouds and on the sand is too bright and makes it hard to see the landscape.  I like the composition with the one person walking on the beach.', '2017-07-02 06:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7521143, 1201558, 150202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, and I like the warm color, but maybe a tad too much, or maybe less on the sky portion.  The smoothness of the lake and the composition with the fence are great.</td>', 'Beautiful scene, and I like the warm color, but maybe a tad too much, or maybe less on the sky portion.  The smoothness of the lake and the composition with the fence are great.', '2017-07-02 06:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
