(7521145, 1201386, 150202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place and beautiful capture.  The shadow on the bottom is great.  The composition isn''t my favorite as the angle doesn''t do it for me.  Lovely colors and light.</td>', 'Beautiful place and beautiful capture.  The shadow on the bottom is great.  The composition isn''t my favorite as the angle doesn''t do it for me.  Lovely colors and light.', '2017-07-02 06:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
