(7521677, 1201733, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge.<br/> <br/>A very fitting study for this challenge that will definitely be in the minority! A lovely landscape with lovely unique light, the composition includes all the interesting features in a pleasing balance and variation of colour. The long shutter speed has given emphasis to the falling water that makes it the important feature that it needs to be. A pleasing entry Otto, thanks</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge. A very fitting study for this challenge that will definitely be in the minority! A lovely landscape with lovely unique light, the composition includes all the interesting features in a pleasing balance and variation of colour. The long shutter speed has given emphasis to the falling water that makes it the important feature that it needs to be. A pleasing entry Otto, thanks', '2017-07-06 08:30:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521679, 1201723, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image that contributes to the challenge.<br/> <br/>A phenomenal skyscape, very nicely captured Marcel. I like the near mono effect with very subtle colour tones at the bottom the frame. The composition is good with the heavy emphasis necessary for this dramatic sky. The only comment I would make is that I would have preferred a natural scene without the huge light poles and housing. The diagonals of the suns rays are very pleasing and nicely contrasted, well done Marcel</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image that contributes to the challenge. A phenomenal skyscape, very nicely captured Marcel. I like the near mono effect with very subtle colour tones at the bottom the frame. The composition is good with the heavy emphasis necessary for this dramatic sky. The only comment I would make is that I would have preferred a natural scene without the huge light poles and housing. The diagonals of the suns rays are very pleasing and nicely contrasted, well done Marcel', '2017-07-06 08:41:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521822, 1201765, 67697, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful capture of light.  Congrats on the red!</td>', 'What a beautiful capture of light.  Congrats on the red!', '2017-07-07 01:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7521996, 1201721, 185714, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM.<br/>Well done Janet!</td>', 'Congrats on the HM.Well done Janet!', '2017-07-07 22:50:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7522444, 1201568, 182284, '<td valign="top">I really liked the way you used the light shining at the edge of the forest. I gave an 8 on this one.</td>', 'I really liked the way you used the light shining at the edge of the forest. I gave an 8 on this one.', '2017-07-10 02:46:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7524536, 1201568, 59029, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club!<br/> <br/>Technically this photo has some strong points, in terms of basic things like focus, ok lighting and using the rule of thirds...but, sorry, it''s just a very bland photo. The focal point seems to be the second tree trunk, and that''s all folks! The title references a microcosm of a forest; here I see a few tree trunks and a lot of grass, which simply doesn''t fulfill my idea of a forest.  I don''t like being harsh, but there is nothing to draw me in and make me want to look more. Even stunning light would have its work cut out for it here.  Look at the top ten images, and learn.<br/> <br/>Hope this helps.<br/> <br/>Susan</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club! Technically this photo has some strong points, in terms of basic things like focus, ok lighting and using the rule of thirds...but, sorry, it''s just a very bland photo. The focal point seems to be the second tree trunk, and that''s all folks! The title references a microcosm of a forest; here I see a few tree trunks and a lot of grass, which simply doesn''t fulfill my idea of a forest.  I don''t like being harsh, but there is nothing to draw me in and make me want to look more. Even stunning light would have its work cut out for it here.  Look at the top ten images, and learn. Hope this helps. Susan', '2017-07-20 22:09:04.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
